@startuml coachify_dockerised_mvp
title Coachify — CV, JD / skills analysis and roadmap design
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #285F91
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #F4F8FC
skinparam nodeBorderColor #8DA6BC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #EFF6FA

actor "User browser" as Browser
component "Existing Profile / account APIs\nAuthentication, onboarding, planning inputs\nAccount-level manual declarations" as Profile
cloud "Configured LLM provider\nGroq initially; server-side adapter" as LLM
cloud "Permitted public interview sources\nCompany sites, Reddit, Glassdoor\nAvailability and access restrictions apply" as Sources

node "Docker Compose — focused design" {
  node "Next.js / React / TypeScript" as Web <<Docker container>>
  node "NGINX API gateway" as Gateway <<Docker container>>

  package "Private backend network" {
    node "CV analyser\nservices/cv-service" as CV <<Docker container>> {
      artifact "Saved upload/review, resumable text chat,\ncorrections, clarifications, explicit CV selection\n/api/v1/cv" as CVAPI
    }
    node "JD / career and skills analyser\nservices/career-service" as Career <<Docker container>> {
      artifact "Specific job or career exploration\nReviewed target confirmation and selection\nAI target generation, research and gaps planned\n/api/v1/career" as CareerAPI
    }
    node "Roadmap and task service\nservices/roadmap-service" as Roadmap <<Docker container>> {
      artifact "Generate plans from versioned analyses\nEdit plans and track task progress\n/api/v1/roadmaps (planned)" as RoadmapAPI
    }
  }

  node "MongoDB — local development" as Mongo <<Docker container>> {
    database "CV-owned database\ncvs\ncv_selections + cv_conversations (operational)" as CVDB
    database "Career-owned database\ncareer_goals + career_target_selections (operational)\ninterview_research\nskill_gap_analyses" as CareerDB
    database "Roadmap-owned database\nPlans, milestones and task history\nSchema to be expanded" as RoadmapDB
  }
  artifact "Service-private temporary CV storage\nOriginal-file cleanup per policy" as Uploads <<Private storage>>
}

Browser --> Web : Use application
Web --> Gateway : /api/v1 requests
Gateway --> Profile : Existing account / profile routes
Gateway --> CV : CV routes
Gateway --> Career : Career routes
Gateway --> Roadmap : Roadmap routes (planned)

' API dependencies point from caller to the service it calls.
CV --> Profile : Validate account / read declarations / confirmed manual additions
CV --> Career : Read selected confirmed context and exact versions
Profile --> CV : Validate explicitly attached source item/version
Career --> Profile : Validate session / read selected context
Career ..> CV : Future selected CV input with source version vector
Roadmap --> Profile : Read deadline and availability
Roadmap --> Career : Read selected versioned gap analysis

CV --> CVDB : Own records only
Career --> CareerDB : Own records only
Roadmap --> RoadmapDB : Own records only
CV --> Uploads : Temporary original access
CV --> LLM : Structured extraction, bounded chat routing and clarification interpretation
Career ..> LLM : Future target skills / research synthesis / gap analysis
Career ..> Sources : Future bounded permitted research retrieval
Roadmap --> LLM : Personalised roadmap generation

note bottom of Career
  One career_goals model: specific_job or career_exploration.
  company may be null. Interview research is reusable public context;
  private CV/chat data must not enter that shared research.
  Persist structured output and bounded evidence, not full raw JD text.
  JD originals/previews use service-private temporary parsing storage.
end note

note bottom of Mongo
  Separate service-owned databases and credentials.
  No cross-service collection queries; use authenticated APIs.
  Production may replace local MongoDB with MongoDB Atlas.
  The users collection in the UML maps to the existing
  Profile/account authority outside this diagram's three-service scope.
end note

legend bottom
  Focused design direction, not a deployment or implementation claim.
  Core scope: CV analyser, JD/career/skills analyser, roadmap service.
  Existing Profile/auth is shown only as an external dependency.
  Dashboard, review/scheduling and future services are intentionally omitted;
  extend this diagram when their scope is agreed.
  Current implementation: Profile/auth/manual declarations, saved CV flow,
  configured extraction/interpretation, source reconciliation, temporary Career previews,
  reviewed targets/conditions and a target-bound input contract. AI target generation, research,
  gap analysis and roadmap remain planned.
  Collection and embedded-object schemas: sibling mongodb_*.mmd files.
endlegend
@enduml
